{"4168320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Archaeologists", "steam_appid": 4168320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Archaeologists is a single-player settlement builder and logistics simulation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your people as they set out to return to an ancient land and reconcile with the spurned god who dwells atop the mountain. Establish settlements to help them put down new roots in this old soil. Raise grand structures to carry them ever upward and to link their populations into a single thriving community. As you climb, dig into the earth beneath their feet and uncover the past that they have long forgotten.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SETTLEMENTS •••</strong> Harvest resources, establish industries, and develop your economy to fund architectural works and archaeological digs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARCHITECTURE •••</strong> Enlist specialists to design grand bridges, staircases, and vehicle routes, enabling the flow of workers and goods between settlements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOGISTICS •••</strong> Manage all your settlements simultaneously, moving resources around as required to ensure that all settlements have what they need to grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARCHAEOLOGY ••• </strong>Dig deep to uncover the story of this place, unlock new architectural possibilities, and unearth valuable technological artifacts from times past.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEGACY ••• </strong>Listen carefully to the songs and stories your people tell each other and ultimately rediscover the truth that waits at the top of the mountain.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE  •••  </strong>Set aside 30-40 hours to experience a single continuous campaign managing all of your settlements simultaneously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNHURRIED  •••  </strong>No enemy will attack and no environmental cataclysm will befall your people. Build your settlements and climb the mountain at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONFIGURABLE</strong>  <strong>•••</strong>  Rich options for configuring difficulty, accessibility, controls, appearance, performance, and interface behavior.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THRIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your first settlement will be reasonably straightforward and should feel quite familiar. Grow your settlement by placing homes, workplaces, and administrative buildings across a tiled map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/9b2363be76a12217c559e30d6e2ee48f.poster.avif?t=1784716020\" width=800 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/9b2363be76a12217c559e30d6e2ee48f.webm?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/9b2363be76a12217c559e30d6e2ee48f.mp4?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage, foster, manufacture and trade your way to economic success. This would be easy, but for the unwelcome attention of the king's ambassador, who seems to always be around here somewhere, muttering about tax bands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/a9211918475899f44d0928c39a4f8ebc.poster.avif?t=1784716020\" width=800 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/a9211918475899f44d0928c39a4f8ebc.webm?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/a9211918475899f44d0928c39a4f8ebc.mp4?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In time, your adventure will lead you to explore the whole island and to reach up towards the top of the mountain. Construct crossings to connect  areas of the mountain, open new maps, and found new settlements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/3285f0b775b583121fdbecc6d455d932.poster.avif?t=1784716020\" width=800 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/3285f0b775b583121fdbecc6d455d932.webm?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/3285f0b775b583121fdbecc6d455d932.mp4?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you expand, you will need to manage all of your settlements simultaneously, shipping resources between them to satisfy local needs. Coordinating the efforts of your workers across settlements adds interesting logistical challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/a2ab60ce3131c59af5e9d7faa3f54ec3.avif?t=1784716020\" width=1560 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you should commit resources to the most important job of all - archaeology. Uncover the island's past,  as well as learning the story of how your own people have come to these  lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/1248b10b246bf929e7a32542666e0415.poster.avif?t=1784716020\" width=800 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/1248b10b246bf929e7a32542666e0415.webm?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/1248b10b246bf929e7a32542666e0415.mp4?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Archaeologists is a single-player settlement builder and logistics simulation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your people as they set out to return to an ancient land and reconcile with the spurned god who dwells atop the mountain. Establish settlements to help them put down new roots in this old soil. Raise grand structures to carry them ever upward and to link their populations into a single thriving community. As you climb, dig into the earth beneath their feet and uncover the past that they have long forgotten.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SETTLEMENTS •••</strong> Harvest resources, establish industries, and develop your economy to fund architectural works and archaeological digs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARCHITECTURE •••</strong> Enlist specialists to design grand bridges, staircases, and vehicle routes, enabling the flow of workers and goods between settlements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOGISTICS •••</strong> Manage all your settlements simultaneously, moving resources around as required to ensure that all settlements have what they need to grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARCHAEOLOGY ••• </strong>Dig deep to uncover the story of this place, unlock new architectural possibilities, and unearth valuable technological artifacts from times past.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEGACY ••• </strong>Listen carefully to the songs and stories your people tell each other and ultimately rediscover the truth that waits at the top of the mountain.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE  •••  </strong>Set aside 30-40 hours to experience a single continuous campaign managing all of your settlements simultaneously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNHURRIED  •••  </strong>No enemy will attack and no environmental cataclysm will befall your people. Build your settlements and climb the mountain at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONFIGURABLE</strong>  <strong>•••</strong>  Rich options for configuring difficulty, accessibility, controls, appearance, performance, and interface behavior.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THRIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your first settlement will be reasonably straightforward and should feel quite familiar. Grow your settlement by placing homes, workplaces, and administrative buildings across a tiled map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/9b2363be76a12217c559e30d6e2ee48f.poster.avif?t=1784716020\" width=800 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/9b2363be76a12217c559e30d6e2ee48f.webm?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/9b2363be76a12217c559e30d6e2ee48f.mp4?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage, foster, manufacture and trade your way to economic success. This would be easy, but for the unwelcome attention of the king's ambassador, who seems to always be around here somewhere, muttering about tax bands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/a9211918475899f44d0928c39a4f8ebc.poster.avif?t=1784716020\" width=800 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/a9211918475899f44d0928c39a4f8ebc.webm?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/a9211918475899f44d0928c39a4f8ebc.mp4?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In time, your adventure will lead you to explore the whole island and to reach up towards the top of the mountain. Construct crossings to connect  areas of the mountain, open new maps, and found new settlements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/3285f0b775b583121fdbecc6d455d932.poster.avif?t=1784716020\" width=800 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/3285f0b775b583121fdbecc6d455d932.webm?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/3285f0b775b583121fdbecc6d455d932.mp4?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you expand, you will need to manage all of your settlements simultaneously, shipping resources between them to satisfy local needs. Coordinating the efforts of your workers across settlements adds interesting logistical challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/a2ab60ce3131c59af5e9d7faa3f54ec3.avif?t=1784716020\" width=1560 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you should commit resources to the most important job of all - archaeology. Uncover the island's past,  as well as learning the story of how your own people have come to these  lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/1248b10b246bf929e7a32542666e0415.poster.avif?t=1784716020\" width=800 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/1248b10b246bf929e7a32542666e0415.webm?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/extras/1248b10b246bf929e7a32542666e0415.mp4?t=1784716020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "The Archaeologists is a single-player settlement builder. Establish multiple settlements through manufacturing and trade. Raise great structures across the mountain to link them into one interconnected economy. Dig into the rock to unearth valuable artifacts and uncover a forgotten past.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/6f87017580b46f48d4e8005107ee85f598828733/header.jpg?t=1784716020", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/26658949e4a9b7724045a7dbe344d7ca04bb005d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784716020", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/26658949e4a9b7724045a7dbe344d7ca04bb005d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784716020", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 3GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 3GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["dogvsbear"], "publishers": ["dogvsbear"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 64, "description": "Adjustable Text Size"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/f6a275b1f608e4c849cfacd0daf2f775c14a5459/ss_f6a275b1f608e4c849cfacd0daf2f775c14a5459.600x338.jpg?t=1784716020", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/f6a275b1f608e4c849cfacd0daf2f775c14a5459/ss_f6a275b1f608e4c849cfacd0daf2f775c14a5459.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784716020"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/5b24fee83e4e0cda76ce825eb7de248b71f8cc05/ss_5b24fee83e4e0cda76ce825eb7de248b71f8cc05.600x338.jpg?t=1784716020", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/5b24fee83e4e0cda76ce825eb7de248b71f8cc05/ss_5b24fee83e4e0cda76ce825eb7de248b71f8cc05.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784716020"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/066217d0c9ad896cb407b3ad6ebd16ba3702c809/ss_066217d0c9ad896cb407b3ad6ebd16ba3702c809.600x338.jpg?t=1784716020", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/066217d0c9ad896cb407b3ad6ebd16ba3702c809/ss_066217d0c9ad896cb407b3ad6ebd16ba3702c809.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784716020"}, {"id": 3, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/13d10c4bed6cb5c111950a9253b1ad53e20d3497/ss_13d10c4bed6cb5c111950a9253b1ad53e20d3497.600x338.jpg?t=1784716020", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/13d10c4bed6cb5c111950a9253b1ad53e20d3497/ss_13d10c4bed6cb5c111950a9253b1ad53e20d3497.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784716020"}, {"id": 4, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/787d89dc775e3df3948574a7d3224e9098a1e51c/ss_787d89dc775e3df3948574a7d3224e9098a1e51c.600x338.jpg?t=1784716020", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168320/787d89dc775e3df3948574a7d3224e9098a1e51c/ss_787d89dc775e3df3948574a7d3224e9098a1e51c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784716020"}, {"id": 5, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.aka